c{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-2t+2)j \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}\\,i-2\\,j \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{\\frac{5}{2}}^{2}+(-2)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{41}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $f(x,y)=1+x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡y$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(t)) & =1+(\\frac{5}{2}t-1)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(-2t+2) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-2).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the integral as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}f(r(t))\\,‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(\\frac{5}{2}t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-2))\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{41}}{2}\\cdot \\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{41}}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}(\\frac{5}{2}t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-2))\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535919 17592186045443 true] [17592186542292 1080 "\\frac{\\sqrt{61}}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}(9{t}^{2}-\\frac{29}{2}t+\\frac{15}{2})\\text{d}t" 13194139535919 17592186045443 true] [17592186542292 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535919 17592186045443 true] [17592186542292 1083 #uuid "30335a9e-1e6a-5240-a835-635bf13e5660" 13194139535919 17592186045443 true] [17592186542293 1080 "\\frac{\\sqrt{145}}{6}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{\\frac{3}{2}t}\\,\\text{d}t" 13194139535919 17592186045443 true] [17592186542293 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535919 17592186045443 true] [17592186542293 1083 #uuid "31d095c6-9894-5dcd-a47c-fbff4a3ac7aa" 13194139535919 17592186045443 true] [17592186542294 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542297 13194139535919 17592186045443 true] [17592186542294 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542328 13194139535919 17592186045443 true] [17592186542294 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542333 13194139535919 17592186045443 true] [17592186542294 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542337 13194139535919 17592186045443 true] [17592186542294 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542350 13194139535919 17592186045443 true] [17592186542294 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 1319413953